        <h2>Overview</h2>

        <p>
            The Grootslang is a legendary cryptid said to inhabit caves in South Africa. It is often described as having the 
            body of a gaint serpent and the head of a elephant.
        </p>

        <h2>Appearance</h2>

        <p>
            Witnesses describe the Grootslang as enormous, with thick scales and powerful tusks.
        </p>

        <h2>Habitat</h2>

        <p>
            Most legends place the creature deep whithin the Richtersveld region near cave systems.
        </p>

        <h2>Reported sightings</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>1930s - Reports from explorers</li>
            <li>1965 - Claimed cave encounters</li>
            <li>Modern sightings continue today</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Theories</h2>

        <p>
            Some believe it is folklore while others think it may be an undiscovered species.
        </p>

